## macOS / Xcode
.DS_Store
build/
DerivedData/
.codewhale/
# The Xcode project is GENERATED from project.yml by XcodeGen — never committed,
# never hand-edited. Run `scripts/bootstrap-xcode.sh` (or `xcodegen generate`) after
# pulling. Editing structure means editing project.yml, then regenerating.
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
*.xcscmblueprint
*.moved-aside
## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
# NOTE: Packages/ holds hydratype's OWN source packages (e.g. HydraCore), not
# checked-out dependencies (modern SPM uses .build/). Do NOT blanket-ignore it —
# only ignore build artifacts nested inside.
Packages/*/.build/
Packages/*/.swiftpm/
## Secrets — Zero Local Secrets axiom: never commit creds
*.env
.env*
!.env.example
